{"4054680": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Floorball League 2010", "steam_appid": 4054680, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "dlc": [4080540], "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Floorball League 2010</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Step onto the court and experience the thrill of floorball with <strong><i>Floorball League 2010</i></strong> (formerly <i>FBL</i> / <i>Floorball League</i>), the first official 3D floorball video game, originally released in 2010. Dive into fast-paced matches with real teams from the International Floorball Federation and the Finnish Salibandyliiga.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Whether you’re a seasoned player or new to the sport, <i><strong>FBL '10</strong></i> delivers engaging floorball action with dynamic arenas and multiple ways to play.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Key Features</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Real Teams and Leagues</strong> – Play with authentic teams from top international and Finnish leagues.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Multiple Game Modes</strong> – Jump into exhibition matches, league play, tournaments, shootouts, or practice in training mode.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Singleplayer &amp; Multiplayer</strong> – Play solo or compete with friends in local multiplayer.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Accessible for Everyone</strong> – Easy-to-learn controls make it approachable for newcomers while still offering fun for fans of the sport.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Relive the excitement of floorball in its early digital form, now updated as <i>Floorball League 2010</i>, and lead your team to victory!</p>", "about_the_game": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Floorball League 2010</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Step onto the court and experience the thrill of floorball with <strong><i>Flo